  "beats": [
    {
      "text": "Every Korean convenience store has",
      "startFrame": 14,
      "endFrame": 60
    },
    {
      "text": "a small shelf right beside the till,",
      "startFrame": 61,
      "endFrame": 112
    },
    {
      "text": "at eye level,",
      "startFrame": 113,
      "endFrame": 134
    },
    {
      "text": "full of little bottles",
      "startFrame": 135,
      "endFrame": 159
    },
    {
      "text": "and foil sticks you can't read.",
      "startFrame": 160,
      "endFrame": 202
    },
    {
      "text": "And here's what visitors get backwards.",
      "startFrame": 203,
      "endFrame": 256
    },
    {
      "text": "Koreans take these on the way into the night.",
      "startFrame": 257,
      "endFrame": 315
    },
    {
      "text": "Not the morning after.",
      "startFrame": 316,
      "endFrame": 356
    },
    {
      "text": "The one that started",
      "startFrame": 363,
      "endFrame": 387
    },
    {
      "text": "the whole category launched in 1992,",
      "startFrame": 388,
      "endFrame": 445
    },
    {
      "text": "and it still holds about",
      "startFrame": 446,
      "endFrame": 477
    },
    {
      "text": "forty-four percent of the market.",
      "startFrame": 478,
      "endFrame": 517
    },
    {
      "text": "Now look near the bottom of the stick.",
      "startFrame": 518,
      "endFrame": 558
    },
    {
      "text": "There's a small badge there",
      "startFrame": 559,
      "endFrame": 586
    },
    {
      "text": "that almost everyone walks straight past.",
      "startFrame": 587,
      "endFrame": 651
    },
    {
      "text": "Since January 2025,",
      "startFrame": 659,
      "endFrame": 706
    },
    {
      "text": "anything sold in Korea",
      "startFrame": 707,
      "endFrame": 738
    },
    {
      "text": "that advertises hangover relief has to prove it.",
      "startFrame": 739,
      "endFrame": 808
    },
    {
      "text": "On actual humans.",
      "startFrame": 809,
      "endFrame": 842
    },
    {
      "text": "The ministry reviewed twenty-eight products,",
      "startFrame": 843,
      "endFrame": 897
    },
    {
      "text": "and three could not produce evidence that held up.",
      "startFrame": 898,
      "endFrame": 961
    },
    {
      "text": "They lost the right to say the word.",
      "startFrame": 962,
      "endFrame": 1013
    },
    {
      "text": "Koreans already know which ones to skip.",
      "startFrame": 1014,
      "endFrame": 1071
    },
    {
      "text": "The rest is at epickor.com.",
      "startFrame": 1072,
      "endFrame": 1128
    }
  ],
